      "docs": "UI suite added. Install the browser once with `npx playwright install chromium`, list your routes in e2e/ui/routes.ts, then run `npx playwright test -c playwright.ui.config.ts`. The first run writes the baselines for this OS; commit them. Later updates: npx shadcn@4.23.0 add wasimjalali/ui-base/regression-suite-update -y --overwrite (it leaves e2e/ui/routes.ts alone)."
    },
